  "description": "This package enables ASP.NET Core web apps and web APIs to use the Microsoft identity platform (formerly Azure AD v2.0).\n      This package is specifically used for web applications, which sign-in users and call Microsoft Graph, and for protected web APIs\n      that call Microsoft Graph. Works specifically with MS Graph SDK v5 and above. For MS Graph SDK v4 support, please use Microsoft.Identity.Web.MicrosoftGraph.",
